      en: ["Regarded as one of the 'rice baskets' of the Dominican Republic", "Officially elevated to the status of a municipality on February 20, 1988", "Located in a fertile coastal plain near the Atlantic Ocean", "Features an intensive irrigation system using canals from nearby rivers", "Key regional supplier for coconut products and tropical fruits", "Part of the María Trinidad Sánchez province in the northeast"],
