      en: ["Named after General Manuel María Castillo (1795–1856)", "Became an independent municipality on September 8, 1896", "One of the world's leading exporters of certified organic cocoa", "The hilly topography favors cultivation under protective shade trees", "Located in the Duarte province, part of the northeastern Cibao", "Economy is primarily based on cocoa, coffee, and cattle ranching"],
